- [ ] **Firestore Backend**: Move Brain memory from file-based (`.brain/`) to Firestore.
    - Why: Cloud Run Jobs are stateless; file memory is lost after execution.
    - Action: Implement `FirestoreStorage` adapter in [memory_ops.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/capabilities/memory_ops.py).
